---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const headExtra = '<title>Explore the Site | Mind Grace and Aasha</title><meta name="description" content="Find child development guides, adult mental health information, care services, practical tools and internship resources across Mind Grace and Aasha."><link rel="canonical" href="https://mindgracencr.in/site-map">';
---
<Layout headExtra={headExtra}>
<main id="main-content" class="seo-page">
<h1>Explore the site</h1>
<p>Browse by the kind of information you need. Child development and early intervention belong to Aasha; adult care, learning resources and academic training have their own collections.</p>
<nav aria-label="Page collections"><a href="#directory-child">Aasha child development</a> · <a href="#directory-adult">Adult care</a> · <a href="#directory-academic">Academic training</a> · <a href="#directory-resources">Resources</a> · <a href="#directory-visit">Visiting</a> · <a href="#directory-clinic">About the clinic</a></nav>
<div id="site-map-list"><p>The complete directory is generated with the static site build. You can also browse <a href="/aasha">Aasha</a>, <a href="/services">care services</a>, <a href="/resources">resources</a> and <a href="/academic-training">academic training</a>.</p></div>
</main>
</Layout>
